<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westfield America half year net A$35.5 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westfield America half year net A$35.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				    35.499</p>
<p>    Distribution (cents)		4.4</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     61.9 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Total assets  A$bln		   3.1 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Net asset backing per unit	104.6 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Sales				   143.9 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Other income			    2.8 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     4.4 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs n/a</p>
<p>    Tax					 4.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Interest				 39.8 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   nil  vs n/a</p>
<p> Distribution is not franked</p>
<p> Pay date August 29</p>
<p> Reg date August 15</p>
<p>NOTE: Westfield America Trust owns U.S. shopping centres and was floated in July 1997 so does not have comparable results. It is managed by Westfield Holdings Ltd.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
